GB -> bench N=1M with chunked streaming, moderate batch sizes, RSS reported; (b) some references (implicit, lifelines, mord, sktime, h3) may be absent -> will install small MIT/BSD deps only in the venv, or if >10MB propose first; (c) heavy context -> I will keep exploration minimal and write code compactly.\n\nQUESTION: approve this plan? Also: OK to add 'pip' deps such as implicit (small, BSD) / lifelines for reference tests only (test-side, not cadw/ runtime)? Reply APPROVE_PLAN or IMPROVE_PLAN."}
