{"seq":411,"ts":"2026-10-24T00:14:11.678Z","who":"orchestrator","event":"route","from":"executor","to":"critic","message":"STAGE 3/8 — PARTIAL, checkpoint (not done; no commit yet).\n\nDONE since your APPROVE_STAGE for stage 3:\n- cadw/ml/meta_learners.py written and WORKING (D.3.2). Contains: MetaLearnerModel (cate / ate / cate_table / ipw_ate / to_dict), fit_meta_learner(kind='t'|'s'), overlap_diagnostics(), and the guarded `_collect` pre-pass. Propensity is fitted with the in-tree `fit_logistic`; overlap diagnostics (n, min, max, share_outside_005_095) are always attached to the model and returned by to_dict().\n- Known-truth synthetic probe PASSED your requirement 1: n=3000, tau = 1.0 + 0.5*x2, e(x) = sigmoid(0.5*x0 - 0.3*x1). T-learner ATE 1.032 vs true 0.994, CATE Spearman rho 0.926; S-learner ATE 0.920, rho 0.947. Overlap: min 0.145, max 0.859, share outside [0.05,0.95] = 0.0.\n- tests/test_meta_learners.py: only the header + _truth/_df/_fit helpers are written so far (1 149 B). The test bodies are NOT yet written — my earlier attempt failed on a Python syntax error (an unterminated string in a comment) and I am rewriting it in small chunks.\n\nNOT done for v0.9.37: the rest of the D.3.2 tests (11 planned: T-learner truth, S-learner truth, constant effect, propensity vs sklearn LogisticRegression by Spearman rho > 0.95, overlap diagnostics shape, positivity-violation flagging, IPW ATE, determinism + multi-batch, guard, errors, source contract), D.3.3 uplift/Qini, D.4.1 MiniRocket, 3 bench scripts + JSONs, 3 notes, roadmap/taxonomy/CHANGELOG/version 0.9.37, suites, and the single v0.9.37 commit.\n\nState is safe: stage 1 = aec5626, stage 2 = a9e559e (both committed). Working tree holds only stage-3 WIP: cadw/ml/meta_learners.py (new), tests/test_meta_learners.py (partial, new), _t1.py/_t2.py/_t3.py/_tmp_sig.py (temp probes to delete), plus the usual untracked .pingis/session.log. uv.lock dirty, never committed. .pingis/plan.md marks stage 3 as [~] with the probe numbers and this exact to-do list recorded, so a fresh session can resume from there.\n\nCONTEXT_LIMIT: executor out of context headroom; stage 3 is at D.3.2 code + probe, tests partially written, no commit. Resume by rewriting tests/test_meta_learners.py in small chunks, then D.3.3 and D.4.1."}
